      "iso_date_of_last_edit": "2026-09-22T08:30:23Z",
      "text": "​Had a wonderful dining experience at Aradhya Grand, Devanahalli!\n\n​Food Highlights:​\nTried both South Indian Thalis featuring Holige and Pheni.\n​Delicious spread with porial, dal, sambar, veg kurma, rasam, hot rotis, rice, baby corn salad, bitter gourd chutney, and fryums.\n\n​Sweets galores:\nDelicious rice kheer plus a lovely surprise scoop of butterscotch ice cream at the end!\n\n​Service & Ambiance:\n​Friendly, attentive customer service.\n​Comfortable and neat dining space.\n​Very clean and well-maintained restroom facilities.\n\n​Verdict: Incredible value for money. Highly recommended if you're in or passing through Devanahalli!",
      "text_original_language": "​Had a wonderful dining experience at Aradhya Grand, Devanahalli!\n\n​Food Highlights:​\nTried both South Indian Thalis featuring Holige and Pheni.\n​Delicious spread with porial, dal, sambar, veg kurma, rasam, hot rotis, rice, baby corn salad, bitter gourd chutney, and fryums.\n\n​Sweets galores:\nDelicious rice kheer plus a lovely surprise scoop of butterscotch ice cream at the end!\n\n​Service & Ambiance:\n​Friendly, attentive customer service.\n​Comfortable and neat dining space.\n​Very clean and well-maintained restroom facilities.\n\n​Verdict: Incredible value for money. Highly recommended if you're in or passing through Devanahalli!",
